00:30:10.759 --> 00:30:11.800
URS HOLZLE: That's right.

00:30:11.800 --> 00:30:14.390
So the image actually shows
how difficult this is.

00:30:14.390 --> 00:30:16.190
This shows a bunch of mountains.

00:30:16.190 --> 00:30:18.980
Mostly white is snow, but
actually in the upper right,

00:30:18.980 --> 00:30:22.870
