it's not snow, it's clouds.

00:30:22.870 --> 00:30:26.990
So that actually sounds
like an interesting problem.

00:30:26.990 --> 00:30:29.670
I assume Airbus has been
working this for a while.

00:30:29.670 --> 00:30:31.969
Is this an easy problem
